  <main id="main-content" class="seo-page"><div class="seo-answer"><strong>Direct answer:</strong> Mind Grace Neuropsychiatric Clinic in Greater Noida treats addiction and substance-use concerns through psychiatric consultation, counselling and relapse-prevention planning, combining medical management with structured psychotherapy.</div>
<section class="seo-hero"><p class="seo-kicker">Educational information</p><h1>Addiction support starts with the right level of care</h1><p class="seo-lead">Substance use, behavioural addiction, withdrawal risk, and dual-diagnosis concerns can need different services. The first step is an honest, non-judgemental assessment.</p><div class="seo-actions"><a class="btn" href="/specialized-consultations">Specialized enquiries</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Contact the clinic</a></div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>What to clarify</h2><div class="seo-grid"><article class="seo-card"><h3>Safety and urgency</h3><p>Withdrawal, overdose risk, severe symptoms, or immediate danger may require emergency or hospital care.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Support needs</h3><p>Assessment may consider substances, pattern, health, mental health, family support, and readiness for change.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Referral options</h3><p>Specialist addiction treatment, rehabilitation, medical care, or community support may be recommended.</p></article></div><div class="seo-note"><strong>Qualified availability:</strong> This page does not promise addiction treatment or rehabilitation at Mind Grace. Suitability and referral are assessed case by case.</div></section>    
  </main>
